      "name": "Primary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Appointment action; shared hover, press and keyboard focus treatment.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-primary\">Записатися <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{font-family:Manrope,Arial,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:30px;min-height:52px;padding:15px 23px;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:var(--blue,#235b92);color:white;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}.ds-button-primary svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ds-button-primary:hover{background:#174672}.ds-button-primary:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #2a829b;outline-offset:5px}.ds-button-primary:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
